 ### Base-NeRF Sampling & Architecture
-Base-NeRF uses a hierarchical proposal network structure. Proposal 1 queries 128 linearly spaced samples. Proposal 2 queries 96 samples using probability density sampling. The final NeRF model queries 48 samples using probability density sampling. At test time, final NeRF sampling is increased to 192 points for higher rendering quality [S3]. The architecture uses Hash Grids and MLPs: Proposal 1 (Hash Grid 5/17/16/64, MLP 1/16), Proposal 2 (Hash Grid 5/17/16/256, MLP 1/16), NeRF (Hash Grid 5/19/16/2048, MLP 1/64) [S3].
