 ## Background
-Two-stage NeRF Rendering was introduced in the original NeRF paper by Mildenhall et al. in 2020 [S1]. It has since become a standard technique in NeRF-based rendering pipelines, with various extensions and optimizations proposed in subsequent works [S2, unofficial][S3][S4, unofficial][S5, S6][S7, unofficial].
